<title>BERMUDA: Nobel hires DLJ to review options.</title>
<headline>Nobel hires DLJ to review options.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nobel Insurance Ltd on Monday said it has hired Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette to assist it in reviewing stategic options.</p>
<p>The options to be considered may include the sale of the company, Noble said.</p>
